ntdll: Reach per-process state through accessors.

The unix side's process globals (the PEB, the main image's info, argv
and the rest) move into struct ios_process_state behind the
IOS_PROCESS_FIELD accessors, so that each threaded child (0006) has its
own; other builds keep the globals. ios_process_callbacks.h lists the
callbacks each process publishes. unix_private.h also declares the
arena and child-process interfaces of 0006 and 0008. env.c skips
wineboot for a prefix made from the template (0012), accepts
STATUS_IMAGE_NOT_AT_BASE, and routes RtlGetCurrentPeb to the current
process. On iOS this links only together with 0006.
